{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994560/extras/28c5c032406be3085c1a71c98af4560b.poster.avif?t=1769533696\" width=780 height=622 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994560/extras/28c5c032406be3085c1a71c98af4560b.webm?t=1769533696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026A half-woman, half-bird stole Ivan\u2019s love, and he now gives chase into the Forest \u2014 a place full of mysterious paths and whispered secrets. There, he must make new friends or foes, uncover their hidden truths, and, most importantly, discover his own \u2014 eternal immortality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sirin's Feather is a visual novel crafted by a solo artist, steeped in the pagan spirit, myths, and legends of Eastern Europe. With a deep plot and choice-driven twists, you take on the role of a young man, Ivan, who must face not only the challenges of the human world but the deities themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994560/extras/b8303e6ed91c99d43d7f3743f35f6f5a.poster.avif?t=1769533696\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994560/extras/b8303e6ed91c99d43d7f3743f35f6f5a.webm?t=1769533696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather your party</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you will meet fellow travelers who, by fate, may become friends or foes. Each has a unique personality, secrets, and personal dramas \u2014 the outcome of the story depends not only on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994560/extras/73898a255582e7af477d99ea604d2fc1.poster.avif?t=1769533696\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994560/extras/73898a255582e7af477d99ea604d2fc1.webm?t=1769533696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the story</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make difficult yet significant decisions that affect the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994560/extras/f3441f6f93a962d143788a9fe2dde623.poster.avif?t=1769533696\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994560/extras/f3441f6f93a962d143788a9fe2dde623.webm?t=1769533696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All around you know far more than you. Listen\u2026 and be rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succumb, wither, rest, find peace, tear yourselves apart, shatter, drown, fade into nothingness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994560/extras/7aa5c76e52b3eed857ac3184f3e6aaec.gif?t=1769533696\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994560/extras/7aa5c76e52b3eed857ac3184f3e6aaec.poster.avif?t=1769533696\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2e19\u00a0</strong>Completely hand-drawn art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2e19\u00a0</strong>Captivating story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2e19\u00a0</strong>Significant choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2e19\u00a0</strong>Atmospheric soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2e19\u00a0</strong>Companions and interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2e19\u00a0</strong>More than ten endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2e19\u00a0</strong>Mysterious and detailed lore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994560/extras/781c1dbc79bb71183f212b9739bc892e.poster.avif?t=1769533696\" width=780 height=580 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994560/extras/781c1dbc79bb71183f212b9739bc892e.webm?t=1769533696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994560?t=1769533696","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994560?t=1769533696","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994560/cc2ef8da362a98fc3c9473dd4b68cb2fdbd09f8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769533696","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994560/cc2ef8da362a98fc3c9473dd4b68cb2fdbd09f8f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769533696","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains implied scenes of death and blood."},"